{
  "name": "Send Email Tasks to ClickUp",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1056,
        80
      ],
      "id": "bb80c7a3-023c-49c9-8a96-21998f055cc9",
      "name": "When clicking ‘Execute workflow’"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "-subject:\"Urgent! Approval Required\" -subject:\"SCHEDULE UPDATE\" -subject:\"New Offer Inquiry – Immediate Attention Required\"",
          "receivedAfter": "={{ $now.toLocal().minus(1, 'hours') }}",
          "receivedBefore": "={{ $now.toLocal() }}"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        -816,
        80
      ],
      "id": "be298842-b1c0-4795-a140-c53c0f99b66a",
      "name": "Get many messages"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Filter emails where text content is 800 characters or less\nconst inputItems = $input.all();\nconst filteredItems = [];\n\nfor (const item of inputItems) {\n  // Check if text exists and is <= 800 characters\n  if (!item.json.text || item.json.text.length <= 800) {\n    filteredItems.push(item.json);\n  }\n}\n\nreturn filteredItems;"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -592,
        80
      ],
      "id": "aef2643a-8612-47e7-8c13-3db6d4315adc",
      "name": "Code"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=The is the email received:\n\n{{ $json.text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an assistant that analyzes email content to determine if it contains a task that should be added to ClickUp.\n\nInstructions:\n\nRead the email subject and body carefully.\n\nIdentify if the email contains a clear, actionable task (e.g., \"Prepare the report by Friday\", \"Follow up with client\", \"Book the meeting room\").\n\nIf a task is present, extract:\n\nTask title (short, descriptive)\n\nTask details/description (full instructions or context from the email)\n\nDue date (if mentioned; format as unix time in milliseconds; leave empty if none). The time now is {{ $now.toLocal().toMillis() }}\n\nPriority (Urgent, High, Normal, Low; leave empty if you can't decipher). Output 1 for low, 2 for normal, 3 for High and 4 for Urgent\n\n\nAssignee (the email of the person to which the task is assigned to. Default to \"executive@executive.com\" if it's not stated)\n\nIf no task is present, state: \"No task detected\".\n\nOutput format (JSON):\n\n{\n  \"contains_task\": true/false,\n  \"task_title\": \"\",\n  \"task_description\": \"\",\n  \"due_date\": ,\n  \"assignee\": \"email\"\n  \"priority\": \n}\n\nAlways remember that the time now is {{ $now.toLocal().toMillis() }}"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -384,
        80
      ],
      "id": "050da6cb-f11e-4691-a752-301e9025b59d",
      "name": "AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -448,
        352
      ],
      "id": "6547d02e-2f8a-4565-80be-c31a6f7548c7",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"contains_task\": true,\n  \"task_title\": \"\",\n  \"task_description\": \"\",\n  \"due_date\": 6355668200,\n  \"priority\": 2,\n  \"assignee\": \"email\"\n}"
      },
